				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8e94e607-9bad-4e8f-ae48-e44ac5938245")
	)
	(text "TPS26630: ILIM 3.65k -> ~5 A, UVLO 196k/75k -> 4.3 V, OVP/MODE/PGTH to GND (latch-off). IMON 20k -> 2.8 V at 5 A into PTB2."
